(
    title: "Chase the Chuck Wagon",
    description: Some("Guide Chuckie the dog through maze screens to the opening just below the chuck wagon, dodging the dogcatcher — three lives — and bouncing objects that freeze him and drain your score. Escaping a maze earns a reward screen where a well-timed button press sends Chuckie to his dish for 100 points, and the expert difficulty switch cuts each maze to thirty seconds. It was never sold in shops — Purina mailed it out for Chuck Wagon dog-food proofs of purchase and destroyed the unshipped stock, making the cart a fixture of collecting lore."),
